*[[Maria do Céu]]<ref>{{cite web |url=http://cjitlnoticias.sapo.tl/nasional/lista-tribunal-rekursu-konaba--142281 |title=Centru Jornalista Investigativo Timor Leste |publisher=Cjitlnoticias.sapo.tl |accessdate=19 April 2012 |archive-date=10 May 2012 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120510223025/http://cjitlnoticias.sapo.tl/nasional/lista-tribunal-rekursu-konaba--142281 |url-status=dead }}</ref>
